       include  them  in  _m_o_u_n_t_f_l_a_g_s, along with the per‐mount‐point flags you
       wish to set (or with the flags you wish to clear missing).   Specifying
       _m_o_u_n_t_f_l_a_g_s as:

           MS_REMOUNT | MS_BIND | MS_RDONLY

       will make access through this mount point read‐only (clearing all other
